152 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 104 0 R
/E (This project presents the design and development of a Smart Vacuum Cleaner Robot using Arduino Uno and low-cost recyclable materials. The robot is capable of automatic movement and obstacle detection using an ultrasonic sensor. A vacuum cleaning mechanism powered by a DC motor helps in collecting dust and small particles from the floor surface. The system uses Arduino-based control connected with motor drivers, gear motors, a servo motor, and sensors to navigate efficiently while avoiding collisions. Going beyond conventional cleaning devices, this proposed system integrates obstacle avoidance with an innovative autonomous waste disposal unit to minimise manual household human intervention. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
